# package.json is deliberately NOT excluded any more. It declares
# "type": "module" for every .js file at the repo root, and the server now
# imports several of them - statsengine.js and the rules modules it pulls in are
# shared with the browser so the two can never disagree. Without it in the
# image, Node has to guess how to parse them.
